message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Autocorrelation Analysis of Time-Series Intensity Traces"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Edwards"
    given-names: "Marc"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python script for calculating normalized autocorrelation curves from
  time-series intensity traces and estimating oscillation periods from the
  first qualifying non-zero autocorrelation peak.
keywords:
  - autocorrelation
  - time-series analysis
  - oscillations
  - fluorescence microscopy
  - Python
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Atypical PI3Ks coordinate chemotaxis, signaling dynamics, and multicellular development in Dictyostelium"
    doi: "10.1242/jcs.265041"
